The SVG files in this folder come from the sources below. The marks themselves are trademarks of
their owners; they are used here only to identify the product.

1. @lobehub/icons-static-svg (MIT, license text below).
   - 1.101.0, color: claude (claude-color.svg, the Claude mark), antigravity (antigravity-color.svg),
     openrouter (openrouter-color.svg).
   - 1.101.0, groq (groq.svg, mono). fill currentColor changed to #F55036, the brand color that
     @lobehub/icons 6.13.0 gives Groq (COLOR_PRIMARY).
   - 1.101.0 (mono variants, "fill: currentColor"): amp, cline, codebuddy,
     command-code (commandcode.svg), copilot, cursor, devin, grok, hermes (hermesagent.svg),
     kilo (kilocode.svg), kimi, kiro, muse, opencode, pi, qoder, qwen.
   - 1.95.1: anthropic, deepseek, google, mistral, ollama, openai, xai.
   The 1.101.0 files had their width/height/style attributes removed so CSS sets the size.
2. emdash (https://github.com/generalaction/emdash, Apache-2.0, apps/emdash-desktop/src/assets/images
   and packages/plugins/src/agents/impl/*/icon.ts), width/height removed, <title> added:
   - droid (droid.svg), letta (letta.svg, #202020 changed to currentColor),
     mimocode (mimocode.svg), prime-agent (prime-agent/icon.ts).
3. omp: the "Oh My Pi" mark as emdash's packages/plugins/src/agents/impl/oh-my-pi/icon.ts
   (Apache-2.0) and orca's OmpIcon (MIT) both draw it, without the dark background square;
   gradient colors #ed4abf, #9b4dff, #5ad8e6 are the brand colors.

